content.text:
The investigation points to one fault: the `recommendation` service's only pod disappeared early in the abnormal window and never returned. Only the frontend's `/recommendations` path is affected, and all other services look like normal volume-driven shifts.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "recommendation",
      "fault_kind": "pod_unavailable",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT attr_k8s_deployment_name, attr_k8s_pod_name, metric, time, value FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE attr_k8s_deployment_name = 'recommendation' ORDER BY time", "claim": "Recommendation pod emits metrics only at 00:06:34 in the abnormal window, then nothing further."},
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT metric, attr_k8s_deployment_name, count(*) n, avg(value) avg_v, min(time) t0, max(time) t1 FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE metric = 'k8s.deployment.available' AND attr_k8s_deployment_name IN ('recommendation','frontend','search') GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "k8s.deployment.available for recommendation averages 0 from 00:06:45 onward, while other deployments stay at 1."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, count(*) n, max(time) last_seen FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name = 'recommendation' GROUP BY 1,2,3 UNION ALL SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, count(*), max(time) FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name = 'recommendation' GROUP BY 1,2,3", "claim": "Recommendation server spans stop after 00:06:25 in normal period and are entirely absent in abnormal period."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "recommendation",
      "to": "frontend",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n, round(avg(duration)/1e6,3) avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name LIKE '%ecommend%' GROUP BY 1,2,3,4", "claim": "All 671 frontend GetRecommendations client spans and HTTP /recommendations server spans return Error with status 500 in about 0.1 ms."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "frontend",
      "to": "frontend",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) n, sum(CASE WHEN attr_status_code = 'Error' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) errs FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name = 'frontend' AND span_name LIKE 'HTTP%' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Frontend error share is 19% in abnormal period, concentrated entirely on the /recommendations endpoint."}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

